# === Key material (CONST-053 / §11.4.30) ===
# Added 2026-09-02 after a credential sweep found an RSA JWT-signing keypair
# (keys/jwt_private.pem) committed by 83bfa02 "Auto-commit" on the disjoint
# hxs-v1 lineage. That key SIGNED REAL RS256 tokens during HXS challenge runs
# and is confirmed present on the origin remote via the hxs-v1 tag, so it must
# be treated as public. History rewriting is forbidden (§11.4.113) — rotation is
# the remedy, and these patterns exist so a reintroduced auth feature cannot
# repeat it. Generate key material per checkout and never commit the output.
*.pem
*.key
keys/

# Third-party tool checkouts live flat in the consumer project (see docs/flat-tools-manifest.tsv)
/tools/opensource/
/tools/test-apps/
